### Variables
@baseUrl = https://unflayed-gilbert-voraciously.ngrok-free.dev/api

@devUserId = user_396cTR8sDnxPxTk8VS4tMfCgd8k
@userId = user_396cTR8sDnxPxTk8VS4tMfCgd8k
@workoutTypeId = workout-squat-001
@devSecret = SuperDuperSecretSecret58

### 1. Get Workout Types (Matches WorkoutType[])
GET {{baseUrl}}/workouts/types
X-Dev-User-Id: {{devUserId}}
X-Dev-Secret: {{devSecret}}
Authorization: Bearer 123

### 2. Create Session (Matches CreateSessionDTO)
# @name createSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/workouts/sessions
X-Dev-User-Id: {{devUserId}}
X-Dev-Secret: {{devSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "{{userId}}",
    "workoutTypeId": "{{workoutTypeId}}",
    "startTime": "2026-02-02T10:00:00Z"
}

### 3. Save a Full Set (Matches SaveSetDTO)
@sessionId = {{createSession.response.body.id}}
POST {{baseUrl}}/workouts/sessions/{{sessionId}}
X-Dev-User-Id: {{devUserId}}
X-Dev-Secret: {{devSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
    "setNumber": 1,
    "startTime": "2026-02-02T10:05:00Z",
    "endTime": "2026-02-02T10:07:00Z",
    "reps": [
        {
            "repNumber": 1,
            "startTime": "2026-02-02T10:05:10Z",
            "endTime": "2026-02-02T10:05:12Z",
            "peakAngle": 85.5,
            "avgFlex": 120.2,
            "quality": "good",
            "sensorDataPoints": [{"t": 1, "a": 45}, {"t": 2, "a": 85}]
        }
    ]
}

### 4. Upsert Calibration (Matches CalibrationDataDto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/calibration
X-Dev-User-Id: {{devUserId}}
X-Dev-Secret: {{devSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "standingAngle": 0.5,
    "standingFlex": 10.5,
    "lastUpdated": "2026-02-02T12:00:00Z"
}

### 5. Get Calibration (Matches CalibrationDataDto)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/calibration
X-Dev-User-Id: {{devUserId}}
X-Dev-Secret: {{devSecret}}

### 6. Delete Calibration (No return value)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/calibration
X-Dev-User-Id: {{devUserId}}
X-Dev-Secret: {{devSecret}}